        "If the fire subcompartment is used for purposes such as production kitchens, school kitchens, laboratories, physics and chemistry rooms, etc. that present a particular risk of a fire occurring in the fire compartment"@en ;
    fbo:hasDomainReference fbo:X21NumberofDoorsExits,
