    fbo:hasDefinition "Det tidsrum, hvor en bygningsdel under brandpåvirkning kan opretholde sin ydeevne i form af f.eks. bæreevne eller adskillende funktion"@da-DK,
        "The period of time during which a building element can maintain its performance, such as load-bearing capacity or separating function, under the influence of fire"@en ;
