    fbo:hasFireExpertGuidance "The prescriptive requirements in DK are EI120/A2-s1,d0, EI120-M/A2-s1,d0, EI60/A2-s1,d0, EI60-M/A2-s1,d0, EI60, EI30 and EW30/EI15, EI2 60, EI2 30" ;
